meta {
  name: Next page
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1.1/search?hasImages=true&q=Hokusai&offset=12&limit=12
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  hasImages: true
  q: Hokusai
  offset: 12
  limit: 12
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 200
  res.body.objectIDs: length 12
}

docs {
  The second batch: the same search, 12 further in. Paging is by offset,
  not by cursor. The app's next offset is the number of ids it has had a
  definite answer about (`PagedArtworks.examined`).

  None of these ids should appear in **Search for a word**. If the
  collection changes between two loads an offset can repeat a result, so
  the app drops ids that are already on screen.
}
